      "content": "okay so if i take it with my pill what's the safest way to do it? u said 100mg but should i take it on an empty stomach or with food? and like how many days do i have to wait before i know if it's actually working or if it's messing with my birth control? i just want to be sure i'm doing this right so i don't have to go to a clinic.",
